        "version": 8,
        "title": "The Signal Orchard",
        "author": "Lantern Trails",
        "description": "A signal-stamp route: Quiet and Powered programs, return journeys and coordinated crossings.",
        "intro": "The finale: two stamps must use both signal states, four more carry fixed programs, and eight parcels pass through three tube pairs. Start quiet. Later hold jade for M1, then turn blue on for M3 after its quiet detour. Pip rings two bells and parks on violet; you ring Home. One keeper rewrite, sealed dock.",
        "ending": "The last letter reaches the orchard. Inside are two empty squares, Quiet and Powered, and space for three cards beneath each. Pip has left the choice to you. Tavi smiles at the unmarked page. “That is how a new adventure starts.”",
        "hint": "Apply East / East / Use. Advance sixteen cards, then step east onto jade. Advance nine cards. Step north, turn the blue wheel, and step south. Advance eighteen cards to finish Pip’s route. Leave it paused, walk east to Home, ring it and fetch the far light. Start/Wait/Pause can run each batch automatically.",
